  "usage": "Give the original part (orig_lcsc, orig_mpn, orig_package, orig_class basic|preferred|extended|unknown, orig_price in $, optional orig_stock), the order (boards, per_board), the Extended loading fee in $ and candidates as rows {lcsc, mpn, package, maker, stock, price, class}. Agents get candidates from the app's /api/parts/search (or MCP part search) and pass them in; run() does no network. It returns the candidates ranked with footprint fit, stock check, effective class and order cost, the best alternative and its cost difference to the original.",
  "sources": [
    "JLCPCB assembly pricing: Basic/Preferred parts without loading fee, Extended parts with a per-part loading fee (jlcpcb.com/parts)",
    "LCSC catalogue search through the app's /api/parts/search",
    "Package-family matching: rule of thumb, verify pinout on both datasheets"
  ],
  "view": true,
  "prompt": "Recommend one alternative from the ranked list, and list what to verify on its datasheet against the original before swapping it."
